  m_text: "<size=20>-  Collect                 to trigger Mega Free Games.\n\n-  When
    triggered, award 10 Free Spins.\n\n-  During Mega Free Games, reel set changes
    to a 3 x 4 x 4 x 4 x 3 formation.\n\n-  All wins are multiplied by 4 in Mega Free
    Games.\n\n-  Like in Free Games, x3 Multiplier Wilds appear on reel 2, and x5
    Multiplier Wilds\n   appear on reel 4.\n\n-  Mega Free Games is re-triggered when
    3 or more Scatters appear.\n         -   5 Scatters awards 20 more free spins\n
    \        -   4 Scatters awards 15 more free spins\n         -   3 Scatters awards
    10 more free spins"
